# Peragus, the fuel depot's maintenance level (TSL, 103PER): HK-50 and the
# dead maintenance officer, the sonic imprint sensor, his voiceprint pieced
# together (HK-50's playback, the security desk's log up the turbolift, the
# maintenance console's log), the airlock opened, the floating mines, the
# space suit, and out onto the asteroid. The way without Persuade
# (DSimpson's "Maintenance, Peragus Fuel Depot"). Starts from the tunnels':
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_depot data/routes/tsl/peragus_depot.route --god
# Walkthroughs: context/walkthroughs/tsl/.
say Those miners could be hurt # HK-50's first talk: the hangar, the
talk                 # override codes, the miners (LSP)
use MainOffCorpse    # the maintenance officer's remains
use MilHighPlstcCylin # across the hall: the sonic imprint sensor and its
                     # datapad (the workbench beside it)
say How can I get into the hangar bay again # [Sonic Sensor] his last
say Can you play back the maintenance officer
use HK50             # words, recorded
talk
fight 25             # the droids down the hall, the Mk II among them
exit Door_to101PER   # the turbolift up to the administration level
say check security records # the security desk: [Sonic Sensor] the mining
say =[Sonic Sensor] Mining droid maintenance logs. # droid maintenance
say log out          # logs, recorded
use SecTer
exit PERDoor103      # back down to the fuel depot
say access maintenance logs # the maintenance station: [Sonic Sensor] the
say =[Sonic Sensor] Access Log 253-15: Voiceprint ID
say return to main console functions # voiceprint log recorded, then
say Enter voiceprint code # the code
say access emergency subroutines # entered; the airlock opened with the
say check for exits  # maintenance officer's override
say check airlock
say maintenance officer override
say log out
use DroCon
fight 15             # the floating mines past the door, from range
use SpaceSuitLocker  # the airlock's storage locker: the space suit (a plot
                     # item the airlock asks for, never worn)
exit AirlockOuterDoor_103PER # out onto the asteroid's surface
save peragus_asteroid
